    "title": "New traffic signal activated in the Hub City - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBBJ 7 Eyewitness News Staff ,\n7 hours ago JACKSON, Tenn. — There’s a new fully operational traffic signal at the intersection of Country Club Lane, Vann Drive and Express Drive. Vann Drive and Express Drive motorists will now have a dedicated traffic signal for crossing the intersection as well as turning left or right onto Country Club Lane. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
